- AFTER the retrains: raise SCHEMA_BLOCK_TOKEN_BUDGET (LLM.py, currently 3500).
  It was sized for Llama 3 8B's 8k context. With Llama 3.1 (128k), Ministral 3 (256k) and
  Gemma 3 (128k) the smallest context becomes 131,072, so the budget can rise and bpic2017
  (event attributes, 4,115 tokens) and angular (9,530) can keep the sections they currently
  drop. Re-measure peak context against the models that will actually run before changing it -
  scratchpad/measure_peak_context.py does this by intercepting the LLM call.
